      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      462.54,
      542.52,
      548.01
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me by section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978,1, Dr. A. D. Susil Premajayantha, the Minister of Education having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of the \u201cBritish School of Commerce (Private) Limited\u201d, a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the Companies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing Registration Number PV75150 and located at No. 19, Mcleod Road, Colombo 4 do by this Order subject to such conditions as specified in Schedule I hereto, recognize the \u201cBritish School of Commerce (Private) Limited\u201d as a Degree Awarding Institute for the purpose of developing Higher Education therein, leading to the award of the Degree specified in Column I of the Schedule II hereto, of which the abbreviation is set out in the corresponding entry in Column II of the Schedule II hereto:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
