      580.38,
      319.82,
      594.22
    ],
    "text": "Conditions",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      604.54,
      542.51,
      642.01
    ],
    "text": "1. The British School of Commerce (Private) Limited (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cinstitute\u201d) shall, when admitting students for the degree programme specified in Schedule II hereto in respect of the Bachelor of Business Management Honours with a minimum of 120 Credits (SLQF Level 6), adhere to the minimum entry qualification of;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      652.54,
      542.53,
      678.01
    ],
    "text": "(a) At least three (3) simple passes (S) in any stream in one and the same sitting at G.C.E. (Advance Level) Examination conducted by the Department of Examinations of Sri Lanka or equivalent qualification.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
